// Graylog 알림(Wazuh 경보) → 판정: 룰 ID 로 '종류·대응·심각도·ATT&CK' 를 정한다
const MAP = {
  '100211': { kind: '브루트포스',       action: 'block',  severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1110 Brute Force' },
  '100232': { kind: '저속 브루트포스',  action: 'block',  severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1110.001 Password Guessing' },
  '100233': { kind: '심야 로그인',      action: 'record', severity: 'Medium',   attack: 'T1078 Valid Accounts' },
  '100230': { kind: 'HTTP 404',         action: 'record', severity: 'Low',      attack: 'T1595 Active Scanning' },
  '100231': { kind: '404 폭주(스캔)',   action: 'block',  severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1595.002 Active Scanning' },
  '100240': { kind: 'Suricata 경보',    action: 'record', severity: 'Medium',   attack: 'T1046 Network Service Discovery' },
  '100241': { kind: 'nmap 스캔',        action: 'block',  severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1046 Network Service Discovery' },
  '100242': { kind: 'sqlmap(SQLi)',     action: 'block',  severity: 'Critical', attack: 'T1190 Exploit Public-Facing App' },
  '100243': { kind: 'Suricata 폭주',    action: 'block',  severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1595 Active Scanning' },
  '100264': { kind: 'Snort 경보',       action: 'record', severity: 'Medium',   attack: 'T1046 Network Service Discovery' },
  '100265': { kind: 'Snort 포트스캔',   action: 'block',  severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1046 Network Service Discovery' },
  '100220': { kind: '웹셸 의심',        action: 'record', severity: 'Critical', attack: 'T1505.003 Web Shell' },
  '100221': { kind: '웹 파일 위변조',   action: 'record', severity: 'Medium',   attack: 'T1565.001 Stored Data Manipulation' },
  '100222': { kind: '실행형 파일 삭제', action: 'record', severity: 'High',     attack: 'T1070.004 File Deletion' },
};
const out = [];
for (const item of $input.all()) {
  const b = item.json.body ?? item.json;              // 웹훅이면 실제 본문은 body
  const events = b.alerts ?? b.events ?? [b];
  for (const e of events) {
    const ruleId = String(e.rule_id ?? '');
    const m = MAP[ruleId] ?? { kind: '기타 Wazuh 경보', action: 'record', severity: 'Low', attack: '-' };
    const ip = String(e.srcip ?? '').trim();
    const agent = e.agent || 'unknown-agent';
    const block = m.action === 'block' && ip !== '';   // 출발지 IP 가 있어야 차단 가능
    const key = block ? ip : `wazuh:${agent}`;          // 인시던트 묶음 키(IP 또는 에이전트)
    const what = ip ? `출발지 ${ip}` : `파일 ${e.file || '-'} (${e.fim_event || '-'})`;
    out.push({ json: {
      kind: m.kind, action: block ? 'block' : 'record', severity: m.severity, attack: m.attack,
      rule_id: ruleId, rule_level: e.rule_level, description: e.description,
      ip, user: e.user || '', file: e.file || '', agent, key,
      student: e.student || 'lsy', source: 'wazuh',
      reason: `[Wazuh ${ruleId}] ${e.description} - ${what} (${m.attack})`.slice(0, 200),
    }});
  }
}
return out;
